===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|nýr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*niwjaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*néwos||new}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/niːr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|nýrri|nýjastur}}

# [[new]]
#: ''Tölvan mín er ekki '''ný'''.''
#:: My computer isn't new.

